# game.saves = files: a ghost made by tools/port/ghost.py (synthetic, never the ROM's), imported from the folder's
# import/, raced in the ghost race on track 0 backward with the default player: the track select's ghost choice
# (func_803A0498) takes it and GhostStart makes it a ghost player (docs/port/SAVES.md 5). Run by
# tools/port/saves_check.py's race scenario, which makes the ghost first.
# until: 0x400000:300
# seconds: 90
# args: --saves files (tools/port/saves_check.py runs it, in a data folder of its own)
# expect: players 2
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen: the default player
16 DOWN 0.1    # the mode screen: the ghost race, two modes down
16.5 DOWN 0.1
17 A
19.5 RIGHT 0.1 # the track select's option: backward on
20 A           # track 0
23 A           # the car select; the race
